\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ### `base44/functions/deleteAccount/entry.ts` (new function)\cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - \cf0 \strokec4 Authenticated endpoint: deletes the signed-in user's Trip, PackingItem, UnpackFeedback, and LearnedPreference records (looped \cf5 \strokec5 `deleteMany`\cf0 \strokec4  by \cf5 \strokec5 `created_by_id`\cf0 \strokec4 , batched until \cf5 \strokec5 `has_more`\cf0 \strokec4  is false), then deletes the User record.\cb1 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - 
\f1\b \cf0 \strokec4 **Important ordering fix found in testing:**
\f0\b0  the User record is deleted 
\f2\i *first*
\f0\i0 ; if that's refused (e.g. the app owner cannot be deleted), the function aborts with 400 
\f1\b **before touching any data**
\f0\b0 . (The first version wiped the caller's data before the owner check fired \'97 do not reorder back.)\cb1 \
